  "knowledge": "Vendor Relationship Strength (VRS)",
  "description": "Measures the strength of relationships between a vendor and their customers",
  "definition": "VRS = (vendrate \\times 10) + \\frac{vendsucccount}{vendtxcount} \\times 50 + (vendchecklvl_numeric \\times 15) - \\frac{venddisputecount}{vendtxcount} \\times 100, \\text{where vendchecklvl_numeric maps Basic=1, Advanced=2, Premium=3, else=0 according to the vendor verification system, and higher scores represent stronger vendor-customer relationships.}"
}

